  "description": "Merry Christmas Village Clipart Bundle featuring 37 beautifully detailed, heartwarming, and high-resolution watercolor illustrations. As seen in the preview image us bord-01_4.jpg, this charming collection perfectly captures a cozy, traditional, and magical winter aesthetic for the holiday season! You will find gorgeous watercolor designs featuring a classic glowing Christmas candle elegantly tied with a large red ribbon bow and golden bells. The bundle also highlights a beautiful snowy winter village scene with cute houses decorated with festive holiday wreaths, candy canes, winter pine branches, and red berries.   Perfect for traditional Christmas sublimation prints, cozy holiday apparel, elegant greeting cards, beautiful tumbler wraps, scrapbooking, aesthetic planner stickers, customized seasonal gifts, and print-on-demand products.What you receive:\n• 37 High-Quality PNG files with transparent backgrounds\n• Size: 12 x 12 inches\n• Resolution: 300 DPI for crisp and clear printing\n• Premium traditional cozy holiday illustration style\n• Commercial use allowed\n• Instant digital download   Ideal for designers, crafters, and small business owners looking for premium, magical, and sophisticated winter village graphics for personal and commercial use.Please note: This is a digital download product. No physical items will be shipped.",
